# Real-WM domain memory and first-frame numbers: one app is started at a time and settles before the next
# (MAKEPAD_RUN_DOMAIN_REPORT=1 prints, per domain, RSS/PSS kB when its start began / at its first frame /
# 5 s later, and the start-to-first-frame time).
wait_frame
sleep_frames 120
key Space logo alt
text "Calculator"
key ReturnKey
domain makepad-app-calculator
sleep_frames 600
domain -
key Space logo alt
text "Clock"
key ReturnKey
domain makepad-app-clock
sleep_frames 600
domain -
key Space logo alt
text "Notes"
key ReturnKey
domain makepad-app-notes
sleep_frames 600
domain -
